    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached Bungalow which enjoys exceptional views of Dingle Harbour, The Mount Brandon Range and surrounding countryside. The spacious bungalow also has an independent self-contained 2 Bedroomed Apartment which is very well maintained. It is situated in a private and peaceful location and only a short drive from Dingle Town. Accommodation includes a Front Porch, Hallway, Kitchen, Dining Room, Living Room, Conservatory, Bathroom, 4 Bedrooms (1 Ensuite). Self Contained Apartment includes an open plan Kitchen/Living/Dining, Toilet, 2 Bedrooms and a shower Room."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "\tDetached Bungalow with Self-Contained Apartment\r\n\tExcellent views of Dingle Harbour, The Mount Brandon Range & the Surrounding Countryside\r\n\tPrivate, Peaceful & Scenic Location\r\n\tApproximately 4 miles/ 5 minute drive from Dingle Town\r\n\tApproximately a 5 minute drive to Ventry’s Blue Flag Beach.\r\n\tAer to Water Central Heating System\r\n\tSituated on C. 0.40 acre\r\n\tDouble Glazed PVC Windows & Doors\r\n\tPublic Water Supply & Septic Tank\r\n\tFibre Broadband available nearby\r\n\tBeing Sold substantially furnished.\r\n\tGarden Shed\r\n\tConvenient to many amenities in the area"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Leaving Dingle travelling on the main road to Ventry, continue on the main road for approximately 2 miles. Take a left turn at the junction for Coláiste Íde. Continue up this road for approximately 1 mile passing the turn of for Holdens Leather Goods Workshop: The property is the fourth house on the left hand side after this turn off."
      }
    ],
